ews: 62; favorites: 22; remixes: 2.\nTags: hero, section, animated, webgl, threejs, cta, dither, effect.\n## Overview\nAura Synthesis Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. It is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.\n\nAura Creator Suite AI Platform Engineers Docs Sign In Get Started Vocal Models Neural Cloning Speech to Text Synthesis _ Deploy hyper-realistic generative voice architectures. Integrate dynamic replication models across…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Synthesis _.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #000000, secondary #0A0A0A, accent #000000, background #000000, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Geist for display moments and Geist for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Aura - Synthesis Simulation</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#000000] text-white antialiased selection:bg-white selection:text-slate-900 flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen p-4 md:p-8 overflow-hidden\" style=\"font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Outer Container: Layout & Materials -->\n    <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-[1400px] aspect-[4/3] max-h-[90vh] bg-[#0a0a0a] rounded-[2rem] border border-white/5 overflow-hidden shadow-[0_0_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] flex flex-col group/shell\">\n\n        <!-- Subtle noise texture overlay -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-50 pointer-events-none opacity-[0.03] mix-blend-plus-lighter\" style=\"background-image: url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noiseFilter'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.65' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noiseFilter)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E&quot;);\"></div>\n\n        <!-- WebGL Background Simulated Canvas -->\n        <canvas id=\"hero-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none opacity-80 mix-blend-screen\"></canvas>\n\n        <!-- Navigation Header -->\n        <header class=\"w-full relative z-40 px-6 md:px-12 py-8 flex items-center justify-between\">\n            <div class=\"stagger-enter opacity-0 translate-y-5 transition-all duration-1000 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <span class=\"text-xl tracking-tight font-medium text-white\">Aura</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Capsule-style secondary navigation -->\n            <nav class=\"stagger-enter opacity-0 translate-y-5 transition-all duration-1000 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] hidden lg:flex items-center gap-1 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md rounded-full p-1 border border-white/5\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-[14px] font-medium text-zinc-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\">Creator Suite</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-[14px] font-medium text-zinc-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\">AI Platform</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-[14px] font-medium text-zinc-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\">Engineers</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-[14px] font-medium text-zinc-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\">Docs</a>\n            </nav>\n\n            <div class=\"stagger-enter opacity-0 translate-y-5 transition-all duration-1000 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] flex items-center gap-6\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hidden md:block text-[14px] font-medium text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Sign In</a>\n                <!-- Primary Action Button -->\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"group relative inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-2.5 bg-white text-black rounded-full text-[14px] font-medium transition-all hover:scale-105 hover:bg-zinc-200\">\n                    <span>Get Started</span>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-base opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Floating Accent Menu -->\n        <aside class=\"stagger-enter opacity-0 translate-y-5 transition-all duration-1000 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] absolute left-12 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 hidden xl:flex flex-col z-30 w-64\">\n            <div class=\"relative py-3 flex items-center group cursor-pointer\">\n                <div class=\"absolute right-0 w-8 h-px bg-white/5\"></div>\n                <div class=\"relative bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/5 shadow-sm rounded-full px-5 py-3 flex items-center gap-3 z-10 w-full transition-colors hover:bg-white/10\">\n                    <div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:microphone-linear\" class=\"text-sm\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-[14px] font-medium text-white\">Vocal Models</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"relative py-2 flex items-center group cursor-pointer pl-6\">\n                <div class=\"absolute left-2 w-6 h-px bg-white/5\"></div>\n                <span class=\"text-[14px] font-medium text-zinc-400 group-hover:text-white transition-colors bg-white/5 px-4 py-2 rounded-full backdrop-blur-md border border-white/5 hover:bg-white/10\">Neural Cloning</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"relative py-2 flex items-center group cursor-pointer pl-6\">\n                <div class=\"absolute left-2 w-6 h-px bg-white/5\"></div>\n                <span class=\"text-[14px] font-medium text-zinc-400 group-hover:text-white transition-colors bg-white/5 px-4 py-2 rounded-full backdrop-blur-md border border-white/5 hover:bg-white/10\">Speech to Text</span>\n            </div>\n        </aside>\n\n        <!-- Main Content Core -->\n        <main class=\"relative z-20 p-6 md:p-12 lg:p-16 flex flex-col items-center justify-end flex-1\">\n\n            <h1 class=\"stagger-enter opacity-0 translate-y-5 transition-all duration-1000 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] text-[5rem] sm:text-[7rem] md:text-[9rem] lg:text-[11rem] leading-[0.9] font-light tracking-tighter bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-indigo-200/50 text-center mb-10 w-full\">\n                Synthesis<span id=\"cursor\" class=\"text-indigo-200/50 transition-opacity duration-75\">_</span>\n            </h1>\n\n            <div class=\"stagger-enter opacity-0 translate-y-5 transition-all duration-1000 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] w-full max-w-6xl grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-end border-t border-white/5 pt-8\">\n\n                <div class=\"lg:col-span-6 xl:col-span-7 flex flex-col\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[18px] leading-[28px] text-zinc-400 max-w-md font-normal\">\n                        Deploy hyper-realistic generative voice architectures. Integrate dynamic replication models across autonomous environments and interactive protocols with infinite scale.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"lg:col-span-6 xl:col-span-5 flex flex-col lg:items-end\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\">\n                        <button class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-white text-black rounded-full text-[14px] font-medium transition-all hover:scale-105 hover:bg-zinc-200 shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]\">\n                            Initialize Runtime\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-base opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/5 text-zinc-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-zinc-200 hover:text-black hover:border-transparent rounded-full text-[14px] font-medium transition-all hover:scale-105\">\n                            Documentation\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </main>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            // Staggered Motion Entry\n            const els = document.querySelectorAll('.stagger-enter');\n            els.forEach((el, i) => {\n                setTimeout(() => {\n                    el.classList.remove('opacity-0', 'translate-y-5');\n                    el.classList.add('opacity-100', 'translate-y-0');\n                }, 150 * i + 100);\n            });\n\n            // Terminal Blinking Cursor (Interval fallback for inline style compliance)\n            setInterval(() => {\n                const cursor = document.getElementById('cursor');\n                if (cursor) cursor.style.opacity = cursor.style.opacity === '0' ? '1' : '0';\n            }, 600);\n\n            // WebGL Background: Simulated Wireframe Torus\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('hero-canvas');\n            const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n            let time = 0;\n            let w, h;\n\n            function resize() {\n                const dpr = window.devicePixelRatio || 1;\n                const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n                w = rect.width;\n                h = rect.height;\n                canvas.width = w * dpr;\n                canvas.height = h * dpr;\n                ctx.scale(dpr, dpr);\n            }\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n            resize();\n\n            const nodes = [];\n            const rows = 35;\n            const cols = 70;\n            for (let i = 0; i < rows; i++) {\n                for (let j = 0; j < cols; j++) {\n                    const u = (i / rows) * Math.PI * 2;\n                    const v = (j / cols) * Math.PI * 2;\n                    nodes.push({ u, v });\n                }\n            }\n\n            function render() {\n                ctx.clearRect(0, 0, w, h);\n                const cx = w / 2;\n                const cy = h / 2 - h * 0.1; // Offset center upwards to frame UI\n\n                // Breathing Pulse via u_time\n                const pulse = Math.sin(time * 0.5) * 0.05 + 1;\n                const R = Math.min(w, h) * 0.35 * pulse;\n                const r = Math.min(w, h) * 0.15 * pulse;\n\n                // Slow Multi-axis Rotation\n                const rotX = time * 0.2;\n                const rotY = time * 0.25;\n                const cosX = Math.cos(rotX), sinX = Math.sin(rotX);\n                const cosY = Math.cos(rotY), sinY = Math.sin(rotY);\n\n                const projected = [];\n                for (let i = 0; i < nodes.length; i++) {\n                    const { u, v } = nodes[i];\n\n                    // Parametric Torus Coordinates\n                    const x3d = (R + r * Math.cos(v)) * Math.cos(u);\n                    const y3d = (R + r * Math.cos(v)) * Math.sin(u);\n                    const z3d = r * Math.sin(v);\n\n                    // Rotate X\n                    const y1 = y3d * cosX - z3d * sinX;\n                    const z1 = y3d * sinX + z3d * cosX;\n\n                    // Rotate Y\n                    const x2 = x3d * cosY + z1 * sinY;\n                    const z2 = -x3d * sinY + z1 * cosY;\n\n                    projected.push({ x: x2, y: y1, z: z2, u, v });\n                }\n\n                // Z-Sorting (Painter's Algorithm)\n                projected.sort((a, b) => b.z - a.z);\n\n                for (let i = 0; i < projected.length; i++) {\n                    const p = projected[i];\n                    const scale = 1000 / (1000 + p.z);\n                    const x2d = cx + p.x * scale;\n                    const y2d = cy + p.y * scale;\n\n                    // Blue-to-Purple Depth Map & Oscillation Mixing\n                    const depth = (p.z + R + r) / ((R + r) * 2);\n                    const mix = (Math.sin(p.u * 2 + time) + 1) * 0.5;\n                    const red = Math.floor(70 + mix * 100);    // Blueish to Purpleish\n                    const green = Math.floor(130 - mix * 50);\n                    const blue = Math.floor(255);\n                    const alpha = Math.max(0.02, 0.7 - depth * 0.65);\n\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    ctx.arc(x2d, y2d, 1.2 * scale, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                    ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(${red}, ${green}, ${blue}, ${alpha})`;\n                    ctx.fill();\n                }\n\n                time += 0.015;\n                requestAnimationFrame(render);\n            }\n            render();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "aura-synthesis-simulation.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/aura-synthesis-simulation.jpg", "source_name": "aura-synthesis-simulation-DESIGN.md", "views": 163, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T14:02:54.234804+00:00"}